# Every configuration section this binary declares, its keys and its per-mode
# baselines. Regenerate with -update.
#
# A line added or removed here is the key space changing. A changed default is a
# changed contract for every node that never wrote that key, so it belongs in a
# diff beside the migration that handles it.

